  "body": "With the addition of the `until-found` state/keyword, the `hidden` attribute is no longer a boolean attribute - but the [table listing of attributes](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#attributes-3) still mentions it as such.  \r\n\r\nInitially thought this could just be updated to state \"Enumerated attribute\", but would it make more sense to list out the keywords in this table instead?\r\n\r\nHave a PR ready for the former, but can adjust if the latter is preferred.  ",
